  "abstract": "Dynamic MoT: the shared temporal basis B is conditioned on input context (per-batch population stats) via a tiny MLP, while per-neuron soft assignments remain learned. Residual y_resid[b,t,n]=\u03b1\u00b7\u03a3_r B(x)[b,r,t]\u00b7P[n,r]. Tests whether context-adaptive temporal profiles help beyond static MoT.",
